*> Resource pack test helpers of the client package (US18; test infrastructure, excluded from
*> coverage). COPY this after CLTEST (after the END PROGRAM of a test program); it adds:
*>   TEST-PACK-DIR USING game directory (PIC X(64)), length, fixture names (PIC X(256),
*>     space-separated): the directory removed, then created with resourcepacks/ holding a copy of
*>     each named pack of client/tests/fixtures/packs (gen_packs.py: folders and .zip files).
*>   TEST-PACK-START USING CLIENT-STATE, game directory, length, fixture names: TEST-PACK-DIR, then
*>     a started client (CL-INIT, name Alice, CL-START).
*>   TEST-PACK-ENABLE USING CLIENT-STATE, pack ids (PIC X(256), space-separated, top first): sets
*>     the enabled list (OP-ENABLED) to those ids and reloads (PACKS-RELOAD), as the pack screen's
*>     Done does without saving.
*>   TEST-DIGEST USING CLIENT-STATE, digest out (PIC X(67912)): checksums of what the packs give the
*>     game: every block-and-item atlas sprite's pixels (by sprite id), every block state's baked
*>     quads (geometry with the pixels of the sprite each uses), every item's icon pixels, every
*>     entity image of the entity atlas, every language text (by key).
*>   TEST-DIGEST-DIFF USING digest before, digest after, text out (PIC X(1024)): what changed:
*>     "sprites <ids> states <ids> items <ids> entities <rows> lang <keys>", each list space-
*>     separated, "-" when nothing.
*>   TEST-PUSH USING CLIENT-STATE, connection, packet id (9 configuration, 82 play), pack id's last
*>     byte (the UUID 00112233-4455-6677-8899-aabbccddeeXX), URL (PIC X(256)), URL length, hash
*>     (PIC X(40), spaces = the empty string), required (0 or 1), prompt (PIC X(64), spaces = absent;
*>     a plain String tag), prompt length: hands PROTO-PACKET a Resource Pack Push (03 0x09).
*>   TEST-POP USING CLIENT-STATE, connection, packet id (8 or 81), pack id's last byte (-1 = no id):
*>     hands PROTO-PACKET a Resource Pack Pop.
*>   TEST-PIXEL USING CLIENT-STATE, sprite id (PIC X(80)), length, text out (PIC X(32)): the RGBA
*>     of the block-and-item atlas sprite's top-left pixel as "r,g,b,a"; a sprite the atlas lacks
*>     is drawn as sprite 1, the missing texture.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PACK-DIR.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-COMMAND             PIC X(1024).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-DIR                  PIC X(64).
 01 L-LENGTH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-NAMES                PIC X(256).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-DIR L-LENGTH L-NAMES.
     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-COMMAND
     STRING "rm -rf " L-DIR(1:L-LENGTH) " && mkdir -p " L-DIR(1:L-LENGTH)
         "/resourcepacks && for n in " DELIMITED BY SIZE
         L-NAMES DELIMITED BY "  "
         "; do cp -R client/tests/fixtures/packs/$n " DELIMITED BY SIZE
         L-DIR(1:L-LENGTH) "/resourcepacks/; done" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-COMMAND
     CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-COMMAND
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PACK-DIR.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PACK-START.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-DIR                  PIC X(64).
 01 L-LENGTH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-NAMES                PIC X(256).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-DIR L-LENGTH L-NAMES.
     CALL "TEST-PACK-DIR" USING L-DIR L-LENGTH L-NAMES
     CALL "CL-INIT" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "Alice" TO CL-NAME
     MOVE 5 TO CL-NAME-LENGTH
     MOVE L-DIR TO CL-GAME-DIR
     MOVE L-LENGTH TO CL-GAME-DIR-LENGTH
     CALL "CL-START" USING CLIENT-STATE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PACK-START.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PACK-ENABLE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ID                  PIC X(80).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-IDS                  PIC X(256).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-IDS.
     MOVE 0 TO OP-COUNT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     PERFORM UNTIL WS-PTR > 256 OR L-IDS(WS-PTR:) = SPACES
         MOVE SPACES TO WS-ID
         UNSTRING L-IDS DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE INTO WS-ID WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         IF WS-ID NOT = SPACES
             ADD 1 TO OP-COUNT
             MOVE WS-ID TO OP-ID(OP-COUNT)
             MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ID)) TO OP-ID-LENGTH(OP-COUNT)
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PACKS-RELOAD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PACK-ENABLE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PIXEL.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-S                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POS                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E1                  PIC ZZ9.
 01 WS-E2                  PIC ZZ9.
 01 WS-E3                  PIC ZZ9.
 01 WS-E4                  PIC ZZ9.
 01 B-ATLAS                PIC X(1073741824) BASED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   PIC X(80).
 01 L-LENGTH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(32).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-LENGTH L-TEXT.
     CALL "ATLAS-FIND" USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-LENGTH WS-S
     IF WS-S = 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-S
     END-IF
     IF WS-S > 0
         SET ADDRESS OF B-ATLAS TO AT-ADDR
         COMPUTE WS-POS = (AT-Y(WS-S) * AT-W + AT-X(WS-S)) * 4 + 1
         COMPUTE WS-E1 = FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE WS-E2 = FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS + 1:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE WS-E3 = FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS + 2:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE WS-E4 = FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS + 3:1)) - 1
         MOVE SPACES TO L-TEXT
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) ","
             FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E4) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PIXEL.


 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-DIGEST.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-S                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-Q                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POS                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SUM                 BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-QUAD                PIC X(120).
 01 B-ATLAS                PIC X(1073741824) BASED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-DIGEST.
    05 L-SPRITE-COUNT      BINARY-LONG.
    05 L-SPRITE OCCURS 128 TIMES.
       10 L-SPRITE-NAME    PIC X(80).
       10 L-SPRITE-SUM     BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 L-STATE-SUM         BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 L-ITEM-SUM          BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 L-ENTITY-SUM        BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 4 TIMES.
    05 L-LANG-COUNT        BINARY-LONG.
    05 L-LANG OCCURS 640 TIMES.
       10 L-LANG-KEY       PIC X(80).
       10 L-LANG-SUM       BINARY-DOUBLE.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-DIGEST.
     INITIALIZE L-DIGEST
     SET ADDRESS OF B-ATLAS TO AT-ADDR
     MOVE AT-SPRITE-COUNT TO L-SPRITE-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-S > AT-SPRITE-COUNT
         MOVE AT-NAME(WS-S) TO L-SPRITE-NAME(WS-S)
         MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
         PERFORM VARYING WS-Y FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-Y >= AT-SH(WS-S)
             PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > AT-SW(WS-S) * 4
                 COMPUTE WS-POS = ((AT-Y(WS-S) + WS-Y) * AT-W + AT-X(WS-S)) * 4 + WS-I
                 COMPUTE WS-SUM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM * 31 + FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS:1)),
                     1000000007)
             END-PERFORM
         END-PERFORM
         MOVE WS-SUM TO L-SPRITE-SUM(WS-S)
     END-PERFORM
     PERFORM VARYING WS-S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-S > 18
         MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
         PERFORM VARYING WS-Q FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-Q > BM-QUAD-COUNT(WS-S)
             MOVE BM-QUAD(WS-S, WS-Q) TO WS-QUAD
             MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-QUAD(9:4)
             PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 92
                 COMPUTE WS-SUM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM * 31 + FUNCTION ORD(WS-QUAD(WS-I:1)),
                     1000000007)
             END-PERFORM
             IF BM-SPRITE(WS-S, WS-Q) > 0
                 COMPUTE WS-SUM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM * 31
                     + L-SPRITE-SUM(BM-SPRITE(WS-S, WS-Q)), 1000000007)
             END-IF
         END-PERFORM
         MOVE WS-SUM TO L-STATE-SUM(WS-S)
         IF IT-SPRITE(WS-S) > 0
             MOVE L-SPRITE-SUM(IT-SPRITE(WS-S)) TO L-ITEM-SUM(WS-S)
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     SET ADDRESS OF B-ATLAS TO EA-ADDR
     PERFORM VARYING WS-S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-S > 4
         MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
         PERFORM VARYING WS-Y FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-Y >= EA-IM-H(WS-S)
             PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > EA-IM-W(WS-S) * 4
                 COMPUTE WS-POS = ((EA-IM-Y(WS-S) + WS-Y) * EA-W + EA-IM-X(WS-S)) * 4 + WS-I
                 COMPUTE WS-SUM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM * 31 + FUNCTION ORD(B-ATLAS(WS-POS:1)),
                     1000000007)
             END-PERFORM
         END-PERFORM
         MOVE WS-SUM TO L-ENTITY-SUM(WS-S)
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE LG-COUNT TO L-LANG-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-S > LG-COUNT
         MOVE LG-KEY(WS-S) TO L-LANG-KEY(WS-S)
         MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
         PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > LG-TEXT-LENGTH(WS-S)
             COMPUTE WS-SUM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM * 31 + FUNCTION ORD(LG-TEXT(WS-S)(WS-I:1)),
                 1000000007)
         END-PERFORM
         MOVE WS-SUM TO L-LANG-SUM(WS-S)
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-DIGEST.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-DIGEST-DIFF.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ANY                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   PIC Z9.
 01 WS-E0                  PIC Z9.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-A.
    05 A-SPRITE-COUNT      BINARY-LONG.
    05 A-SPRITE OCCURS 128 TIMES.
       10 A-SPRITE-NAME    PIC X(80).
       10 A-SPRITE-SUM     BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 A-STATE-SUM         BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 A-ITEM-SUM          BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 A-ENTITY-SUM        BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 4 TIMES.
    05 A-LANG-COUNT        BINARY-LONG.
    05 A-LANG OCCURS 640 TIMES.
       10 A-LANG-KEY       PIC X(80).
       10 A-LANG-SUM       BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 L-B.
    05 B-SPRITE-COUNT      BINARY-LONG.
    05 B-SPRITE OCCURS 128 TIMES.
       10 B-SPRITE-NAME    PIC X(80).
       10 B-SPRITE-SUM     BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 B-STATE-SUM         BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 B-ITEM-SUM          BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
    05 B-ENTITY-SUM        BINARY-DOUBLE OCCURS 4 TIMES.
    05 B-LANG-COUNT        BINARY-LONG.
    05 B-LANG OCCURS 640 TIMES.
       10 B-LANG-KEY       PIC X(80).
       10 B-LANG-SUM       BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-A L-B L-TEXT.
     MOVE SPACES TO L-TEXT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     STRING "sprites" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > B-SPRITE-COUNT
         MOVE 0 TO WS-K
         PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > A-SPRITE-COUNT
                 OR A-SPRITE-NAME(WS-K) = B-SPRITE-NAME(WS-I)
             CONTINUE
         END-PERFORM
         IF WS-K > A-SPRITE-COUNT
             MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
             STRING " +" B-SPRITE-NAME(WS-I) DELIMITED BY "  " INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         ELSE
             IF A-SPRITE-SUM(WS-K) NOT = B-SPRITE-SUM(WS-I)
                 MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
                 STRING " " B-SPRITE-NAME(WS-I) DELIMITED BY "  " INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
             END-IF
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     IF WS-ANY = 0
         STRING " -" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-IF
     STRING " states" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 18
         IF A-STATE-SUM(WS-I) NOT = B-STATE-SUM(WS-I)
             MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
             COMPUTE WS-E0 = WS-I - 1
             STRING " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E0) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     IF WS-ANY = 0
         STRING " -" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-IF
     STRING " items" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 18
         IF A-ITEM-SUM(WS-I) NOT = B-ITEM-SUM(WS-I)
             MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
             COMPUTE WS-E0 = WS-I - 1
             STRING " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E0) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     IF WS-ANY = 0
         STRING " -" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-IF
     STRING " entities" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 4
         IF A-ENTITY-SUM(WS-I) NOT = B-ENTITY-SUM(WS-I)
             MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
             MOVE WS-I TO WS-E
             STRING " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     IF WS-ANY = 0
         STRING " -" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-IF
     STRING " lang" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > B-LANG-COUNT
         PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > A-LANG-COUNT
                 OR A-LANG-KEY(WS-K) = B-LANG-KEY(WS-I)
             CONTINUE
         END-PERFORM
         IF WS-K > A-LANG-COUNT
             MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
             STRING " +" B-LANG-KEY(WS-I) DELIMITED BY "  " INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         ELSE
             IF A-LANG-SUM(WS-K) NOT = B-LANG-SUM(WS-I)
                 MOVE 1 TO WS-ANY
                 STRING " " B-LANG-KEY(WS-I) DELIMITED BY "  " INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
             END-IF
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     IF WS-ANY = 0
         STRING " -" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-DIGEST-DIFF.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PUSH.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 4096.
 01 WS-ID                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-UUID                PIC X(16).
 01 WS-MAX                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 32767.
 01 WS-MAX40               BINARY-LONG VALUE 40.
 01 WS-HASH-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FLAG                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BYTE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-CONN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-PACKET               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-LAST                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-URL                  PIC X(256).
 01 L-URL-LENGTH           BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-HASH                 PIC X(40).
 01 L-REQUIRED             BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-PROMPT               PIC X(64).
 01 L-PROMPT-LENGTH        BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN L-PACKET L-LAST L-URL L-URL-LENGTH L-HASH
         L-REQUIRED L-PROMPT L-PROMPT-LENGTH.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-PACKET
     MOVE FUNCTION HEX-TO-CHAR("00112233445566778899aabbccddee00") TO WS-UUID
     MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(L-LAST + 1) TO WS-UUID(16:1)
     CALL "PB-PUT-UUID" USING PB-BUFFER WS-UUID
     CALL "PB-PUT-STRING" USING PB-BUFFER L-URL L-URL-LENGTH WS-MAX
     MOVE 40 TO WS-HASH-LENGTH
     IF L-HASH = SPACES
         MOVE 0 TO WS-HASH-LENGTH
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-PUT-STRING" USING PB-BUFFER L-HASH WS-HASH-LENGTH WS-MAX40
     CALL "PB-PUT-BOOL" USING PB-BUFFER L-REQUIRED
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FLAG
     IF L-PROMPT-LENGTH > 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-FLAG
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-PUT-BOOL" USING PB-BUFFER WS-FLAG
     IF WS-FLAG = 1
         MOVE 8 TO WS-BYTE
         CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-BYTE
         CALL "PB-PUT-USHORT" USING PB-BUFFER L-PROMPT-LENGTH
         PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > L-PROMPT-LENGTH
             COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(L-PROMPT(WS-I:1)) - 1
             CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-BYTE
         END-PERFORM
     END-IF
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "PB-GET-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-ID
     CALL "PROTO-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN PB-BUFFER WS-ID
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PUSH.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-POP.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 256.
 01 WS-ID                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-UUID                PIC X(16).
 01 WS-FLAG                BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-CONN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-PACKET               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-LAST                 BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN L-PACKET L-LAST.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-PACKET
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FLAG
     IF L-LAST >= 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-FLAG
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-PUT-BOOL" USING PB-BUFFER WS-FLAG
     IF WS-FLAG = 1
         MOVE FUNCTION HEX-TO-CHAR("00112233445566778899aabbccddee00") TO WS-UUID
         MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(L-LAST + 1) TO WS-UUID(16:1)
         CALL "PB-PUT-UUID" USING PB-BUFFER WS-UUID
     END-IF
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "PB-GET-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-ID
     CALL "PROTO-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN PB-BUFFER WS-ID
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-POP.
